        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Salary disclosure includes amounts that have been allocated to National Grid Generation LLC (reporting entity). The salary amount allocated to other companies was zero. These salary amounts exclude incentive compensation payments and reflect base salary paid by the company from 1-1-2025 through 12-31-2025.</span>
